      "name": "Mycelial Rewiring",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When the biotech giant Strikes a creature with their mycelial whip or spore cannon, they leave some of the fungus behind, which immediately attempts to graft itself onto the targeted creature. The affected creature must attempt a DC 28 Fortitude Saving Throw save; on a failure, its implanted augmentations that count toward its implant limit cease to function for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
